{
 "0447fa356eb5": {
  "file": "0447fa356eb5.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.86,
  "bytes": 23421,
  "text": "That part isn't true. Here's the true sentence. Try it once more."
 },
 "125ae952c647": {
  "file": "125ae952c647.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.44,
  "bytes": 26877,
  "text": "Only the county decides. Leave out the promise and try it once more."
 },
 "bc594a0a81f6": {
  "file": "bc594a0a81f6.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.95,
  "bytes": 35949,
  "text": "Welcome. You're about to gather signatures to put the Neighborhood Libraries Act on the ballot.",
  "take": 3
 },
 "36955dfa0494": {
  "file": "36955dfa0494.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.34,
  "bytes": 26301,
  "text": "About 25% get thrown out. Today you learn which ones count."
 },
 "bcb02eb8c08f": {
  "file": "bcb02eb8c08f.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.36,
  "bytes": 20397,
  "text": "The county checks each signer's voter record for four things."
 },
 "bddfbdee8456": {
  "file": "bddfbdee8456.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.71,
  "bytes": 16509,
  "text": "1. Is this person registered to vote?"
 },
 "6ec2bc9c6b3d": {
  "file": "6ec2bc9c6b3d.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.71,
  "bytes": 16509,
  "text": "2. Are they registered in this county?"
 },
 "b1a2144d60c0": {
  "file": "b1a2144d60c0.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.26,
  "bytes": 19821,
  "text": "3. Are they registered at the address they wrote?"
 },
 "5eae70937173": {
  "file": "5eae70937173.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.02,
  "bytes": 18381,
  "text": "4. Does the signature look like theirs?"
 },
 "3d1a34ed7efb": {
  "file": "3d1a34ed7efb.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 10.18,
  "bytes": 61293,
  "text": "With four yeses, the signature counts. With one no, it's thrown out. Only the county decides, so never promise anyone their signature will count."
 },
 "58ff6765d946": {
  "file": "58ff6765d946.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 5.76,
  "bytes": 34797,
  "text": "Now you're the county. Five people signed at Westside Market today. Decide which lines count."
 },
 "b91fb3bb7235": {
  "file": "b91fb3bb7235.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.79,
  "bytes": 40989,
  "text": "Three of those five lines get thrown out. Not one was about handwriting. All three were about who signed."
 },
 "295c94a4ea88": {
  "file": "295c94a4ea88.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.94,
  "bytes": 29901,
  "text": "Luis signed twice. The county checks a sample, about 3 lines in every 100."
 },
 "d5549edb4d60": {
  "file": "d5549edb4d60.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 6.91,
  "bytes": 41709,
  "text": "The drive loses about 1,000. One double in the sample tells the county the stack holds many more."
 },
 "658ae81967e3": {
  "file": "658ae81967e3.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 9.48,
  "bytes": 57117,
  "text": "Nate had the better hour. Signatures that count are the score. Libraries for All checks your signatures. Your bonus is paid on the ones that count."
 },
 "790b9ce1ffa4": {
  "file": "790b9ce1ffa4.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.78,
  "bytes": 52941,
  "text": "Here's the question that screens out the most bad lines. A woman in scrubs is walking up. Ask her if she's registered to vote in L.A. County."
 },
 "da35d4e5d01b": {
  "file": "da35d4e5d01b.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.87,
  "bytes": 11469,
  "text": "I am. Why do you ask?"
 },
 "442d634bcf27": {
  "file": "442d634bcf27.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 3.46,
  "bytes": 20973,
  "text": "Me? I vote in every election. Why do you ask?"
 },
 "1d42ed8fd6e1": {
  "file": "1d42ed8fd6e1.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 2.18,
  "bytes": 13341,
  "text": "Makes sense. I vote every time."
 },
 "a703d6ef9f13": {
  "file": "a703d6ef9f13.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 0.96,
  "bytes": 5997,
  "text": "Oh, okay."
 },
 "510173be7081": {
  "file": "510173be7081.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 0.58,
  "bytes": 3693,
  "text": "Hi."
 },
 "61bd533eeec5": {
  "file": "61bd533eeec5.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.25,
  "bytes": 7725,
  "text": "I'm good, thanks."
 },
 "8920ad14037d": {
  "file": "8920ad14037d.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.8,
  "bytes": 11037,
  "text": "I'd rather decide for myself."
 },
 "1fbbc18e0d34": {
  "file": "1fbbc18e0d34.mp3",
  "who": "marisol",
  "voice": "el:EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL:0.88",
  "dur": 1.39,
  "bytes": 8589,
  "text": "Okay, bye now."
 },
 "50279200aa51": {
  "file": "50279200aa51.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.52,
  "bytes": 15357,
  "text": "Now watch Lena do the whole job once."
 },
 "48015756e5f2": {
  "file": "48015756e5f2.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 6.17,
  "bytes": 37245,
  "text": "Hi there! This petition is for longer library hours. Are you registered to vote in L.A. County?"
 },
 "5622a9f80317": {
  "file": "5622a9f80317.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.74,
  "bytes": 4701,
  "text": "I am."
 },
 "a66fde5314b6": {
  "file": "a66fde5314b6.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 13.54,
  "bytes": 81453,
  "text": "I'm paid to gather signatures, and here are this month's top funders. It funds longer evening and weekend hours at branch libraries, paid for by a new state tax on digital ad sales. Have you signed this one already?"
 },
 "8d3797994f61": {
  "file": "8d3797994f61.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.62,
  "bytes": 3981,
  "text": "No."
 },
 "50235bdb22e1": {
  "file": "50235bdb22e1.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 3.91,
  "bytes": 23709,
  "text": "Then here's the petition. Will you sign to put it on the ballot?"
 },
 "135143f6fc20": {
  "file": "135143f6fc20.mp3",
  "who": "ines",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.6,
  "bytes": 3837,
  "text": "Sure."
 },
 "4a5b080d005c": {
  "file": "4a5b080d005c.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 4.82,
  "bytes": 29181,
  "text": "Print your name, sign, then write the address where you're registered to vote."
 },
 "328f56a25fe7": {
  "file": "328f56a25fe7.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 1.37,
  "bytes": 8445,
  "text": "All set. Thank you!"
 },
 "2d0894828f13": {
  "file": "2d0894828f13.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.43,
  "bytes": 20829,
  "text": "Two of Lena's lines are the law. Say each one once."
 },
 "461f84736714": {
  "file": "461f84736714.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.38,
  "bytes": 14493,
  "text": "Good. Take those two lines with you today."
 },
 "c96e8768b598": {
  "file": "c96e8768b598.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.35,
  "bytes": 50349,
  "text": "You're outside Westside Market with your table and your board. A man with a coffee is heading for the door. Say hello and see if he'll stop."
 },
 "c2821f6d7752": {
  "file": "c2821f6d7752.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 2.28,
  "bytes": 13917,
  "text": "Uh, yeah, I'm registered. What's up?"
 },
 "afd4fc8cdee8": {
  "file": "afd4fc8cdee8.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.06,
  "bytes": 6573,
  "text": "Sorry, running late!"
 },
 "3e2828f6c31d": {
  "file": "3e2828f6c31d.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.18,
  "bytes": 7293,
  "text": "Sorry, what's this?"
 },
 "735718422134": {
  "file": "735718422134.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 0.53,
  "bytes": 3405,
  "text": "Hi."
 },
 "a83fb96f06c9": {
  "file": "a83fb96f06c9.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.18,
  "bytes": 7293,
  "text": "I'm good, thanks."
 },
 "43cca5785473": {
  "file": "43cca5785473.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 1.63,
  "bytes": 10029,
  "text": "I'd rather decide for myself."
 },
 "fd3b7f857ea9": {
  "file": "fd3b7f857ea9.mp3",
  "who": "ben",
  "voice": "el:cjVigY5qzO86Huf0OWal:0.88",
  "dur": 0.94,
  "bytes": 5853,
  "text": "Okay, bye now."
 },
 "3a0c94914800": {
  "file": "3a0c94914800.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 2.4,
  "bytes": 14637,
  "text": "Now listen to Lena. She does this all day."
 },
 "0a35b1f9a4cc": {
  "file": "0a35b1f9a4cc.mp3",
  "who": "tanya",
  "voice": "el:XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX:0.88",
  "dur": 1.08,
  "bytes": 6717,
  "text": "I am, yeah."
 },
 "49037e875ada": {
  "file": "49037e875ada.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 1.49,
  "bytes": 9165,
  "text": "First, she said hi."
 },
 "3c4fc6067033": {
  "file": "3c4fc6067033.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.72,
  "bytes": 22557,
  "text": "Second, she said what the petition is for in one short sentence."
 },
 "6330849e0f89": {
  "file": "6330849e0f89.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.8,
  "bytes": 47037,
  "text": "Third, she asked if the woman is registered to vote in L.A. County. A yes means she can sign, and now they're talking."
 },
 "9f02d43beafb": {
  "file": "9f02d43beafb.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 4.66,
  "bytes": 28173,
  "text": "Fourth, she never asked for a minute. The whole thing took about five seconds."
 },
 "22764a1662e2": {
  "file": "22764a1662e2.mp3",
  "who": "dwayne",
  "voice": "el:nPczCjzI2devNBz1zQrb:0.88",
  "dur": 1.92,
  "bytes": 11757,
  "text": "Nope. Never got around to it."
 },
 "0d3eabf555ba": {
  "file": "0d3eabf555ba.mp3",
  "who": "lena",
  "voice": "el:cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9:0.88",
  "dur": 1.63,
  "bytes": 10029,
  "text": "No problem. Have a good one!",
  "take": 1
 },
 "c5a359557b89": {
  "file": "c5a359557b89.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.2,
  "bytes": 43437,
  "text": "That man can't sign, so Lena lets him go and turns to the next person. His 'no' just saved her a minute."
 },
 "db26b8b77e1e": {
  "file": "db26b8b77e1e.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.67,
  "bytes": 22269,
  "text": "Words are half the job. The other half is where you stand."
 },
 "0d6db75e7b0a": {
  "file": "0d6db75e7b0a.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 8.11,
  "bytes": 48909,
  "text": "B is right. People stop for someone who is standing, looking at them and ready. The table is just where your things sit."
 },
 "2ee3b022d19d": {
  "file": "2ee3b022d19d.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.3,
  "bytes": 44013,
  "text": "B is right. Stand where people pass, and never block the way. Anyone who wants to keep walking can."
 },
 "f27f8c35b172": {
  "file": "f27f8c35b172.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 3.77,
  "bytes": 22845,
  "text": "Rico is new. Listen for the one thing that goes wrong."
 },
 "26ef63870fab": {
  "file": "26ef63870fab.mp3",
  "who": "rico",
  "voice": "el:bIHbv24MWmeRgasZH58o:0.88",
  "dur": 6.94,
  "bytes": 41853,
  "text": "Hi! Do you have a minute? This petition is for longer library hours. Are you registered to vote in L.A. County?"
 },
 "eb7142e1ddff": {
  "file": "eb7142e1ddff.mp3",
  "who": "hank",
  "voice": "el:pqHfZKP75CvOlQylNhV4:0.88",
  "dur": 1.42,
  "bytes": 8733,
  "text": "Not really, sorry."
 },
 "7fd95c05720d": {
  "file": "7fd95c05720d.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 15.43,
  "bytes": 92829,
  "text": "About 5% to 10% stop. Most people keep walking, even past the best canvassers. A no isn't about you. The canvassers who gather the most ask everyone, and someone else is always coming."
 },
 "0a49c4d5fb7e": {
  "file": "0a49c4d5fb7e.mp3",
  "who": "coach",
  "voice": "el:bRlp5mUWs01wX4H4oW4X:0.9",
  "dur": 7.94,
  "bytes": 47901,
  "text": "It's your turn again. Three people are coming, one after another. Say your opener to each one, and your best opener counts."
 },
 "b7ad644f5939": {
  "file": "b7ad644f5939.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.46,
  "bytes": 9021,
  "text": "Yes, I am, dear."
 },
 "dca104d6caf9": {
  "file": "dca104d6caf9.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.44,
  "bytes": 8877,
  "text": "Sorry, what's this for?"
 },
 "b9ce9f2bc442": {
  "file": "b9ce9f2bc442.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 0.5,
  "bytes": 3261,
  "text": "Hi."
 },
 "1e13b0690779": {
  "file": "1e13b0690779.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.27,
  "bytes": 7869,
  "text": "I'm good, thanks."
 },
 "14ca7174666c": {
  "file": "14ca7174666c.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.87,
  "bytes": 11469,
  "text": "I'd rather decide for myself."
 },
 "7c79acefc8bb": {
  "file": "7c79acefc8bb.mp3",
  "who": "soojin",
  "voice": "el:hpp4J3VqNfWAUOO0d1Us:0.88",
  "dur": 1.15,
